# PSR-5f6b — finance findings store

## Scope (exactly one file)

| File | Prior direct calls | Notes |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| `workspace-finance/recon/findings-store.ts` | 6 | one injectable default + five locals |

All switch to
`getBackgroundAdminClient(BACKGROUND_ADMIN_REASON.BG_FINANCE_RECON)`.
`upsertFinanceReconFindings(..., admin = …)` keeps injectable override; only the
default changes.

